invariant: INV-72
file: src/hash.c
catches: hash_dispatch_test
reason: ch_sha512_init keeps CH_CPU_PROBED in the state and not the value
  its caller passed, so every update and final of the stream runs the
  portable code whatever the caller stated. Every digest is still right,
  so no vector objects. bin/hash_dispatch_test counts the calls into each
  path, and requires a stream started under CH_CPU_AVX2, or on arm64
  CH_CPU_CONSTANT_TIME_SHA512, to make every one on sha512_hw.c.

--- old
    sha512_init(&s->hash);
    s->cpu = cpu;
--- new
    sha512_init(&s->hash);
    s->cpu = CH_CPU_PROBED;
